A balance assignment without a commodity is skipped as a syntax error. The
API returns the valid transaction and exposes the parser warning to the user.

========== API ==========

accounts({})

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Equity:Opening

2024-01-02 Missing commodity
  Assets:Cash  = 1
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "comment": null,
    "used": true,
    "transactionCount": 1
  },
  {
    "account": "Equity:Opening",
    "comment": null,
    "used": true,
    "transactionCount": 1
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[SYNTAX_ERROR] Expected a commodity symbol for balance assignment
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:11:19 (affected lines 10-12)
